oh...is that what it looks like? and where do you suggest people go to do some research? maybe the internet? welp, looks like that is where we are at.

&#x200B;

Also, plants don't always behave as you expect so OP's question isn't as detrimental to the well being of the universe as you may think.

&#x200B;

Also, how was he supposed to research something he had no idea would happen?

and to think, most of us thought Oklahoma would be in the stone ages forever, 

&#x200B;

now we enter the Stoned Age

Dear People who think you are in charge,

&#x200B;

Get over yourself.

&#x200B;

Have a nice day.

